# HL3 artifacts: containers and benchmark output are regenerated, never committed.
# Conformance fixtures under spec/conformance/ are the deliberate exception.
*.hl3
*.hl3z
!spec/conformance/**/*.hl3
/out/
/bench-out/
# Official DIC Challenge images are downloaded, never committed (L-5).
/benchmarks/challenge/cache/
